  "limits": [
    "Received percept packets were not logged. Visibility is reconstructed from saved sampled positions, saved issued aims plus frozen facing arithmetic, and event-derived spear trajectories; it is not a directly logged percept field.",
    "Returning threat gate reconstruction uses logged counter estimatedPosition and checks against its saved threat diagnostic. It does not rerun the controller or reproduce its memory.",
    "Observed associations are endogenous. There is no attack-suppression, latency-matched, or alternate-defence intervention here, so no causal claim about attack or rule failure follows.",
    "250 ms is the counter sensor lag, not a guaranteed dodge window; decision alignment, visibility, projection, available lateral movement, and advance warning matter.",
